---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
const metadata={title:'About Ouooo',description:'Ouooo is a curated sourcing catalog for rosaries, devotional jewelry, and custom religious gifts.'};
---
<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="bg-[#f6f1e8]"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-24 text-center"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.22em] text-primary">About Ouooo</p><h1 class="mt-5 text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight sm:text-6xl">A clearer way to discover meaningful products.</h1><p class="mx-auto mt-7 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-muted">Ouooo organizes rosaries, devotional jewelry, and custom religious gifts around the questions wholesale buyers actually ask.</p></div></section>
  <section class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 px-6 py-20 lg:grid-cols-2"><div><h2 class="text-4xl font-semibold">Built for thoughtful sourcing</h2></div><div class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-8 text-muted"><p>Instead of presenting another crowded online store, Ouooo combines structured product information with practical guidance about materials, sizes, styles, customization, and packaging.</p><p>Our goal is simple: help buyers understand their options, create a better sourcing brief, and start a useful conversation.</p></div></section>
  <section class="border-y border-black/10"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-8 px-6 py-16 sm:grid-cols-3">{[['01','Curated','Products are organized by buyer intent, not marketplace taxonomy.'],['02','Clear','Specifications and customization options are easy to compare.'],['03','Practical','Every page leads toward a focused wholesale conversation.']].map(([num,title,text])=><div><span class="text-xs text-primary">{num}</span><h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold">{title}</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-muted">{text}</p></div>)}</div></section>
</Layout>
